B.aFs=new A.pb("Peer Tutoring","Free peer tutoring groups",B.dW,B.bP,"/marketplace","Falling behind in a module or struggling with a concept? Peer Tutoring connects you with fellow students who have already passed those courses and are willing to help \u2014 either for free as a community contribution or for a small fee through the marketplace.","\u2022 Search by module code or subject area\n\u2022 Book a one-on-one or group session via the marketplace\n\u2022 Sessions can be in person or online via a shared link\n\u2022 Rate your tutor after each session to build trust scores\n\u2022 Earn income yourself by listing as a tutor in your strong subjects")
B.Z3=new A.H(58504,"MaterialIcons",null,!1)
B.aFt=new A.pb("Mentorship","Connect with a student mentor",B.Z3,B.fe,null,"Having someone a few years ahead of you who has navigated the same challenges can make a huge difference. Mentorship pairs you with a senior student or young professional who can guide you on academics, career choices, financial decisions, and life on campus.","\u2022 Complete a short profile about your goals and challenges\n\u2022 Get matched with a mentor based on your field of study\n\u2022 Monthly one-on-one sessions via video or in person\n\u2022 Access a shared resource library curated by mentors\n\u2022 Become a mentor yourself once you reach your second year")
B.aFu=new A.pb("Quick Income","Fast-paying gigs near you",B.rr,B.k,"/marketplace","As a student, unexpected expenses or a tight month can be stressful. Quick Income connects you to short-term, fast-paying gigs that match your skills \u2014 things like tutoring, delivery, data capturing, or graphic design tasks posted by people nearby.","\u2022 Browse gigs posted within 5 km of your campus\n\u2022 Filter by skill: writing, design, tutoring, tech\n\u2022 Accept a gig and get paid directly to your Gude Wallet\n\u2022 Most gigs pay within 24\u201348 hours of completion\n\u2022 Your Marketplace Activity score improves with each completed gig")
B.aFv=new A.pb("Food Support","Affordable meals & food banks",B.zj,B.v,null,"Food insecurity is one of the biggest hidden challenges for students. Food Support helps you locate nearby campus food banks, soup kitchens, community meal programmes, and subsidised cafeterias so that going hungry never gets in the way of your studies.","\u2022 Map of food banks and meal programmes within 10 km\n\u2022 Campus dining discounts for qualifying students\n\u2022 Weekly community meal schedules updated in real time\n\u2022 Anonymous access \u2014 no forms or judgement required\n\u2022 Share a location tip with fellow students directly in the app")
B.ZN=new A.H(62162,"MaterialIcons",null,!1)
B.aFw=new A.pb("Talk to Someone","Campus counselling services",B.ZN,B.ag,null,"Sometimes the pressure of studies, finances, and life all builds up at once. Talk to Someone connects you to trained campus counsellors and peer support groups where you can speak freely, get coping strategies, and feel heard \u2014 without any stigma.","\u2022 Direct booking with your institution's counselling centre\n\u2022 Anonymous peer support chat available 24/7\n\u2022 Crisis line numbers displayed for urgent situations\n\u2022 Weekly virtual group check-in sessions you can join\n\u2022 Your Wellbeing Check-in score improves when you engage with support")
B.aFx=new A.pb("Budget Help","Restructure your budget",B.fr,B.av,"/wallet/budget","Feeling like money runs out before the month ends? Budget Help gives you a personalised plan based on your actual Gude Wallet spending. It identifies where you are overspending and suggests realistic adjustments so you can stay on top of essentials like food, transport, and data.","\u2022 Gude analyses your last 30 days of wallet transactions\n\u2022 You receive a breakdown: needs vs wants vs savings\n\u2022 Set new category limits with one tap\n\u2022 Weekly nudges remind you when you are close to a limit\n\u2022 Your Financial Health signal improves as you stay within budget")
